---
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /archive/
title: Archive
shortTitle: Archive
description: Every system I've built or owned beyond the six case studies, dated and by stack, in one table. QA automation, AI evaluation and data engineering.
lede: The case studies are the deep version of six systems. This is the breadth version of all of them, everything else I've built or owned, in one place.
bodyWidth: wide
---
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th scope="col">Year</th>
            <th scope="col">System</th>
            <th scope="col">Context</th>
            <th scope="col">Stack</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {% for item in archive %}
        <tr>
            <td>{{ item.year }}</td>
            <td>{% if item.href %}<a href="{{ item.href | url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ item.title }}{% endif %}</td>
            <td>{{ item.context }}</td>
            <td>{{ item.stack | join(", ") }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>
